# Grainlet devtools (`grainlet/devtools`)

DEV only. Install the hook **before** app signals are created; mount the panel under providers.

```js
import {
  installDevtoolsHook, getDevtoolsHook,
  GrainletDevtools, QueryDevtools,
} from 'grainlet/devtools';
```

```js
if (import.meta.env.DEV) {
  installDevtoolsHook();
}
const hook = getDevtoolsHook();
hook?.getSnapshot(); // recent signal/effect events
hook?.subscribe((record) => console.log(record));
```

```jsx
{import.meta.env.DEV ? (
  <GrainletDevtools queryClient={queryClient} />
) : null}

// Queries only
<QueryDevtools client={queryClient} />
```

```js
// Bad — ship GrainletDevtools in production bundles
```
